<item>
<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-10-12T07:34:09.383Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 12 Oct 2026 07:34:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistan has suspended the Khyber Pakhtunkhwa provincial government led by Imran Khan's party, labeling the move a coup, while security forces in Kurram repelled a cross-border infiltration, killing one Pakistani soldier and twelve militants, including Afghan Taliban fighters. A Houthi missile strike hit Riyadh airport, killing a Pakistani national and wounding eleven others. The Taliban are exploiting European fears of migrants, and Afghanistan announced a potential China trade route to the Persian Gulf. The conflict remains deadly, with 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/12/world/asia/europe-taliban-deportations-migrants.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxPMF95Nm5HV1pQeTVrX1hkaU52bkVfQUNCcjlMMVVUazlFalZpd3dnTVdvOTAxMWdZMk1wU1hfNHkyYXBVY2ZnbnVUa0N2Nm9uOTVTYVQzeGphOExkTWtoRElvUzBqMS1PWkpOQ1VpZy1VN0tUQ2hmYzV5WG1uRVFBb00yb3RjZDZ6andza0lBak9HVXl2QVFZeWk4NXVpc0d4OTVnX2FSY203allXNVlLa1lENGI1bnFLWG1IQVZlS0NyYjZWTUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE01QU9MT2pwaXdVMjUwQXJmX1RpbkRXTFpfRENNa1VJVzFzVzg3YWpKNFRVTDgwa21uMHd1TkRtWVdfQ18tRUtJUA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxNYkZnRXJHTHlPWG9Bam5Vd1hvdkNyMnd5dVVWaGZXWlZMcnZDNzctLXdmdEJzNzdsMUpPODkxUEtsNHJWRk1JYU9jczgwalBZeFdzVmNudEthY0lFd29IOW00cnZCXzFtdXVUbTJ3SjlnNEZ4djd4REJsVDg2VTZoaGlkX3d5WXEzaC1FelJVZTBlX3Y4SkdLc0xkRkxrek1NeUg1Z0JCODBCWVk1ZXlOT09MMnQzVHFjd1JkZ1dnUzc?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/oct/12/imran-khans-party-decries-coup-after-pakistan-suspends-provincial-government&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;htt